Description: SecuBox P2P - Peer-to-Peer Network Hub
 P2P network management with peers, services, mesh visualization, and
 threat intel. Includes master-link enrollment (token issuance, peer
 approval, join workflow) served at /master-link/ and
 /api/v1/p2p/master-link/*.
 .
 As of 1.7, this package absorbs the master-link role that was
 previously shipped as a separate (but never nginx-reachable)
 secubox-master-link package. That package was decommissioned on
 2026-09-15 (#1362): it had been reduced to a documentation directory
 owning no code at all. The master-link role is unaffected — it lives here.
